43,2101]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[37,304][1043,2101]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="Top-Rated High-Protein Vegetarian Breakfasts" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,341][969,394]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="Starting your day with a protein-rich vegetarian breakfast can help stabilize energy levels, curb mid-morning cravings, and keep you feeling full longer. A balanced morning meal that includes protein alongside complex carbohydrates and healthy fats supports sustained focus and can prevent impulsive snacking. Many vegetarian-friendly ingredients like lentils, oats, dairy, tofu, nuts, and seeds make it easy to create a satisfying and protein-packed breakfast." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,410][1006,830]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="2" text="Dietary Context" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,856][314,898]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="3" text="The following breakfast ideas are suitable for lacto-ovo vegetarians, meaning they may include eggs and dairy products. Many of these options can be adapted for a vegan diet with simple substitutions." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,919][1006,1123]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="4" text="High-Protein Breakfast Options" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1149][627,1196]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="5" text="Tofu Scramble" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1222][334,1269]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="6" text="A versatile and savory option that mimics scrambled eggs." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1295][989,1337]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="7" text="• Key Protein Sources: Tofu is the primary protein source, often enhanced with vegetables. A serving can contain between 14 and 21 grams of protein." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1363][1006,1489]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="8" text="• Quick Tip: For a flavorful scramble, press the tofu to remove excess water and use spices like turmeric, cumin, and nutritional yeast." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1505][1006,1631]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="9" text="Greek Yogurt Parfait" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1657][435,1704]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="10" text="A quick and easy layered breakfast that requires no cooking." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1730][1006,1826]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="11" text="• Key Protein Sources: Plain Greek yogurt provides a substantial amount of protein, often 15-20 grams per cup. Nuts, seeds, and granola add extra protein and fiber." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1852][1006,1978]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="12" text